        "id": 5642
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-05T15:54:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tend to agree that returning `kInvalidScale` is odd in this case, so ultimately I\u0027d like to land on option #2.  But it\u0027s probably easier to get this change in with option #1, and then tweak Blink \u0026 Skia for #2.",
      "parentUuid": "d382aa98_ff2839fe",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 341,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 343,
        "endChar": 80
      },
      "revId": "5e93163b48d2ba121a40f0247c8a0eef63a76f8d",
